0 -13 Td
(Login flow:) Tj
0 -13 Td
(1. User enters email and password.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(2. Backend verifies the password.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(3. Backend creates a one-time OTP.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(4. OTP is shown on the screen.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(5. User enters the OTP.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(6. Backend verifies the OTP.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(7. Backend creates an auth token.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(8. User is redirected based on role.) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
