0 -13 Td
(1. User opens Forgot Password.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(2. User enters email address.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(3. Backend generates a password reset OTP.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(4. OTP is shown on the screen.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(5. User enters OTP and a new password.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(6. Backend verifies OTP and updates password hash.) Tj
