0 -13 Td
(OTP Storage Rules) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- OTP values are hashed before being stored in auth_otps.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- OTP records include a purpose: login or password_reset.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- OTP records expire after a short time.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Used OTP records are marked as used.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Failed attempts are counted.) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(Session and Token Security) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- The backend issues an authentication token after OTP verification.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Tokens are stored in the auth_tokens table as hashes.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- API requests require the token for protected endpoints.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Admin endpoints require role = admin.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Client endpoints require role = client or the authenticated user's own data.) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
